    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PROPERTY PARTNERS OBRIEN SWAINE are delighted to offer this beautiful 3 bedroomed semi detached residence which is nicely positioned within the popular development of Courtown Cove. Courtown Harbour and beach are only a short walk away, as are local shops and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nNo. 11 offers a large open plan living space with large patio areas to the front and the rear of the property. There are 3 double bedrooms with ample storage, as well as a family bathroom and ensuite. \r\n\r\nLocal shops , restaurants and the seafront are all within minutes walk away. Gorey town Centre with its lively Main Street , local shops, schools and many eateries and pubs is a short 10 minute drive away. \r\n\r\nCourtown also benefits from being a short drive to the M11 motorway meaning access to South Dublin is reached in approximately an hour while Wexford town is only 35 minutes away.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen, bathroom, 3 bedrooms and ensuite\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: Tiled floors, ESB fuse box, understairs storage, spotlights\r\n\r\nBathroom: Tiled floor, WC, WHB and bath, tiled splashback, wall-hung mirror and shelf, cabinet\r\n\r\nLiving Room/ Kitchen: Feature fireplace, electric fire insert, patio doors to front patio, TV point\r\n\r\nKitchen: Wall and floor mounted units, tiled floors and splashback, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan, plumbed for dishwasher, washing machine and stainless steel sink, door to rear garden\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Carpet, built in wardrobes, wall mounted electric fire\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nLanding: Carpet, access to hotpress and storage in eves\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Carpet, built in wardrobes, Velux window\r\n\r\nEnsuite: WC, WHB and shower, tiled shower surround, wall hung mirror, cabinet, shaving light\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Carpet, 2 Velux windows, built in wardrobes, access to eves storage, access to attic\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside \r\nFront ? Communal parking, open green space, south west facing patio and lawn area, side access to rear\r\nRear ? Low maintenance garden laid to gravel, planted areas, fully fenced"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Electric storage heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nBathroom & Ensuite\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nOpen plan living/ kitchen/ dining\r\nSunny south facing patio\r\nSmall development\r\nPrivate communal parking\r\nLow maintenance rear garden\r\nBuilt c.2002\r\nExtends to approximately 83 sq metres\r\nBER : C3\r\nExcellent location close to Courtown Harbour\r\nLocated in a small development of only 12 properties"
      },
